  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/cucumber?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></p><p style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=view&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Cucumber 是一個包含我其他模組共用程式碼與功能的模組。</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#999\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當進階提示啟用時，為方塊和物品添加顯示其標籤（Tags）的提示資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當進階提示啟用時，為物品添加顯示其NBT資料的提示資訊。（預設關閉）</span></li>\n</ul><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#999\"><strong>我的模組</strong></span><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:24px\"><br></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agriculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘農業<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agradditions\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘農業擴充<br></a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神秘自動化</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-customization\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘自訂化</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">擴充合成<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pickle-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">醃瓜調整<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-jetpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵製噴射背包<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-buckets\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多桶子</a></span></li>\n</ul>",
